#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "SmokePing-poller"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Den Cacti-poller som körs på, eller delar ett filsystem med, SmokePing-värden. Endast denna poller läser SmokePing-data."

