msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "SmokePing-datakatalog"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Värdet på datadir från SmokePings konfiguration, så som SmokePing ser det."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Cacti-montering av datakatalogen"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "En skrivskyddad bind- eller NFS-montering av SmokePing-datakatalogen inuti Cactis RRA-sökväg. Cacti läser endast RRD-filer inuti sin RRA-sökväg och aldrig via en symbolisk länk."

